{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"standards\": [\n    {\n      \"std\": \"1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"从试探着靠近、被看见后的不安、确认对方没有退开，到愿意坦然表达喜欢并接受未来的不确定，人物的经历、行动和情绪转折都能顺着扫出来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"话与感受大体揉合自然，声音、身体和情绪的描写多数能接住人物当下的处境，没有明显的内容分家或来回跳转。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"整体没有明显的冗长负担，但 S11 对同一种自我接纳的感受有连续重复表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"整体叙述自然，但少数感受短语带有分析性、抽象化的表达，不完全像普通人平常说感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"5\",\n      \"verdict\": \"不可评估\",\n      \"note\": \"没有提供 DAG 定稿原文，无法核对内容覆盖。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"6\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"大部分感受保留了具体的身体反应、光影、声音和比喻，没有普遍压缩成笼统的喜悦、悲伤或不安。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"7\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"各屏停留时间与信息量总体匹配，关键短语有明确的视觉提示，定时出现也能帮助观众对上音乐，没有明显来不及读取或故事主干被打断的情况。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"quote\": \"不再藏着喜欢；这是我的感情，我不再为它道歉；觉得自己这么在乎对方也没什么不好。\",\n      \"why\": \"三处连续表达的都是不再为自己的喜欢感到羞愧、愿意承认这份感情。第一处已经交代了不再隐藏，后两处又重复确认相近的态度，没有形成足够明显的新行动或情绪变化，增加了一些同屏扫读量。\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"跨段\",\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"quote\": \"S08：身体恢复弹性，带一点玩心和调情般的回应。；S11：前面悬置的期待似乎终于得到满足。；S12：那支温柔晴朗的歌在这里被放到开阔的尺度。\",\n      \"why\": \"「恢复弹性」「悬置的期待」「开阔的尺度」带有分析或评论口吻，不是普通人自然描述身体感受、音乐感受时最容易使用的说法。观众需要先把它们转译成身体松快起来、先前的期待终于有了回应、音乐一下变得开阔，才得到具体意思。理解不至于中断，但增加了一小步提炼成本。\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "13317e1e-42f3-42ce-bad6-cd9d1c5ffcff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T102432949963Z", "elapsed_seconds": 385.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T10:30:58.777267+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0667fbbf10be6fda2c35c01ceb20a943c7945bf851bd250d53f07286e38feb60", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T102432949963Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4ca5daf15bbd3e0d3cdbbc5f9dd679963f906c9fc27872388072f42273bab12a"}}}
